\f1\fs40\'d0\f0 o\'e0n L\f1\u432?\f0 u B\f2\lang1066\u7843?\f0\lang9 o H\f2\lang1066\u7841?\f0\lang9 nh\line Nguy\f2\lang1066\u7877?\f0\lang9 n Th\f2\lang1066\u7883?\f0\lang9  Hi\f2\lang1066\u7873?\f0\lang9 n\par
Tr\f2\lang1066\u7847?\f0\lang9 n Trung Ni\'ean\line Tr\f2\lang1066\u7883?\f0\lang9 nh Thanh B\'ecnh\par
Ng\lang1033 uy\f2\lang1066\u7877?\f0\lang1033 n Cao Th\'f9y Lan\par
\lang9\par
\fs44\line\par
C\'e2u 1: Gi\f2\lang1066\u7899?i thi\u7879?u v\u7873? ph\u7847?n m\u7873?m SPSS v\u7873? t\f0\lang1033\'e1c d\f2\lang1066\u7909?ng, c\f0\lang1033\'e1c c\'e2u l\f2\lang1066\u7879?nh c\f0\lang1033\'f3 \'fd ngh\f1\u297?a g\f0\'ec, c\'e1c bi\f2\lang1066\u7871?n n\f0\lang1033\'e0o \f1\'f0\u432?\f2\lang1066\u7907?c s\u7917? d\u7909?ng trong ph\u7847?n m\u7873?m.\cf0\b0\par
\b Gi\u7899?i thi\u7879?u v\u7873? SPSS\b0 : SPSS (Statistical Package for the Social Sciences) l\f0\lang1033\'e0 m\f2\lang1066\u7897?t ph\u7847?n m\u7873?m th\u7889?ng k\f0\lang1033\'ea d\'f9ng \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7875? ph\f0\lang1033\'e2n t\'edch d\f2\lang1066\u7919? li\u7879?u. N\f0\lang1033\'f3 \f1\'f0\u432?\f2\lang1066\u7907?c s\u7917? d\u7909?ng r\u7897?ng r\f0\lang1033\'e3i trong c\'e1c l\f1\u297?nh v\f2\lang1066\u7921?c nghi\f0\lang1033\'ean c\f2\lang1066\u7913?u khoa h\u7885?c x\f0\lang1033\'e3 h\f2\lang1066\u7897?i, y h\u7885?c, kinh t\u7871?, v\f0\lang1033\'e0 nhi\f2\lang1066\u7873?u l\f1\u297?nh v\f2\u7921?c kh\f0\lang1033\'e1c.\par
\b T\'e1c d\f2\lang1066\u7909?ng c\u7911?a SPSS\b0 :\par
\f0\lang1033 -\f2\lang1066 Ph\f0\lang1033\'e2n t\'edch th\f2\lang1066\u7889?ng k\f0\lang1033\'ea m\'f4 t\f2\lang1066\u7843?: T\f0\lang1033\'ednh to\'e1n c\'e1c ch\f2\lang1066\u7881? s\u7889? th\u7889?ng k\f0\lang1033\'ea nh\f1\u432? trung b\f0\'ecnh, \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7897? l\u7879?ch chu\u7849?n, t\u7847?n s\u7889?,...\par
\f0\lang1033 -\f2\lang1066 Ph\f0\lang1033\'e2n t\'edch t\f1\u432?\u417?ng quan v\f0\'e0 h\f2\lang1066\u7891?i quy: X\f0\lang1033\'e1c \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7883?nh m\u7889?i quan h\u7879? gi\u7919?a c\f0\lang1033\'e1c bi\f2\lang1066\u7871?n.\par
\f0\lang1033 -\f2\lang1066 Ph\f0\lang1033\'e2n t\'edch ph\f1\u432?\u417?ng sai (ANOVA): So s\f0\'e1nh trung b\'ecnh gi\f2\lang1066\u7919?a c\f0\lang1033\'e1c nh\'f3m.\par
-Ki\f2\lang1066\u7875?m \f1\'f0\f2\u7883?nh gi\u7843? thuy\u7871?t: Ki\u7875?m tra c\f0\lang1033\'e1c gi\f2\lang1066\u7843? thuy\u7871?t th\u7889?ng k\f0\lang1033\'ea.\par
-Ph\'e2n t\'edch nh\'e2n t\f2\lang1066\u7889?: Gi\u7843?m s\u7889? l\f1\u432?\f2\u7907?ng bi\u7871?n b\u7857?ng c\f0\lang1033\'e1ch t\'ecm ra c\'e1c nh\'e2n t\f2\lang1066\u7889? chung.\par
\f0\lang1033 -\f2\lang1066 Ph\f0\lang1033\'e2n t\'edch chu\f2\lang1066\u7895?i th\u7901?i gian: Ph\f0\lang1033\'e2n t\'edch d\f2\lang1066\u7919? li\u7879?u theo th\u7901?i gian.\par
\b C\f0\lang1033\'e1c c\'e2u l\f2\lang1066\u7879?nh c\f0\lang1033\'f3 \'fd ngh\f1\u297?a trong SPSS:\par
\b0\f0 -\f1 GET DATA: \'d0\f2\lang1066\u7885?c d\u7919? li\u7879?u t\u7915? c\f0\lang1033\'e1c ngu\f2\lang1066\u7891?n kh\f0\lang1033\'e1c nhau (v\'ed d\f2\lang1066\u7909?: Excel, CSV, database).\par
\f0\lang1033 -\f2\lang1066 COMPUTE: T\f0\lang1033\'ednh to\'e1n c\'e1c bi\f2\lang1066\u7871?n m\u7899?i t\u7915? c\f0\lang1033\'e1c bi\f2\lang1066\u7871?n \f1\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e3 c\'f3.\par
-RECODE: Thay \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7893?i gi\f0\lang1033\'e1 tr\f2\lang1066\u7883? c\u7911?a bi\u7871?n.\par
\f0\lang1033 -\f2\lang1066 SELECT IF: L\u7885?c d\u7919? li\u7879?u d\u7921?a tr\f0\lang1033\'ean \f1\'f0i\f2\lang1066\u7873?u ki\u7879?n.\par
\f0\lang1033 -\f2\lang1066 FREQUENCIES: T\f0\lang1033\'ednh t\f2\lang1066\u7847?n s\u7889? c\u7911?a c\f0\lang1033\'e1c bi\f2\lang1066\u7871?n.\par
\f0\lang1033 -\f2\lang1066 DESCRIPTIVES: T\f0\lang1033\'ednh c\'e1c ch\f2\lang1066\u7881? s\u7889? th\u7889?ng k\f0\lang1033\'ea m\'f4 t\f2\lang1066\u7843?.\par
\f0\lang1033 -\f2\lang1066 CORRELATIONS: T\f0\lang1033\'ednh h\f2\lang1066\u7879? s\u7889? t\f1\u432?\u417?ng quan gi\f2\u7919?a c\f0\lang1033\'e1c bi\f2\lang1066\u7871?n.\par
\f0\lang1033 -\f2\lang1066 REGRESSION: Ph\f0\lang1033\'e2n t\'edch h\f2\lang1066\u7891?i quy.\par
\f0\lang1033 -\f2\lang1066 ANOVA: Ph\f0\lang1033\'e2n t\'edch ph\f1\u432?\u417?ng sai.\par
\f0 -\f1 T-TEST: Ki\f2\lang1066\u7875?m \f1\'f0\f2\u7883?nh T.\par
\f0\lang1033 -\f2\lang1066 CHI-SQUARE: Ki\u7875?m \f1\'f0\f2\u7883?nh Chi b\f0\lang1033\'ecnh ph\f1\u432?\u417?ng.\par
\b C\f0\'e1c bi\f2\lang1066\u7871?n \f1\'f0\u432?\f2\u7907?c s\u7917? d\u7909?ng trong ph\u7847?n m\u7873?m SPSS:\par
\b0\f0\lang1033 -\i\f2\lang1066 Bi\u7871?n \f1\'f0\f2\u7883?nh t\f0\lang1033\'ednh \i0 (Qualitative variables):\par
+Bi\f2\lang1066\u7871?n danh ngh\f1\u297?a (Nominal variables): C\f0\lang1033\'e1c bi\f2\lang1066\u7871?n kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng c\'f3 th\f2\lang1066\u7913? t\u7921? (v\f0\lang1033\'ed d\f2\lang1066\u7909?: gi\u7899?i t\f0\lang1033\'ednh, m\'e0u s\f2\lang1066\u7855?c).\par
\f0\lang1033 +\f2\lang1066 Bi\u7871?n th\u7913? b\u7853?c (Ordinal variables): C\f0\lang1033\'e1c bi\f2\lang1066\u7871?n c\f0\lang1033\'f3 th\f2\lang1066\u7913? t\u7921? (v\f0\lang1033\'ed d\f2\lang1066\u7909?: m\u7913?c \f1\'f0\f2\u7897? h\f0\lang1033\'e0i l\'f2ng, tr\'ecnh \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7897? h\u7885?c v\u7845?n).\par
\f0\lang1033 -\i\f2\lang1066 Bi\u7871?n \f1\'f0\f2\u7883?nh l\f1\u432?\f2\u7907?ng \i0 (Quantitative variables):\par
\f0\lang1033 +\f2\lang1066 Bi\u7871?n r\u7901?i r\u7841?c (Discrete variables): C\f0\lang1033\'e1c bi\f2\lang1066\u7871?n ch\u7881? nh\u7853?n gi\f0\lang1033\'e1 tr\f2\lang1066\u7883? s\u7889? nguy\f0\lang1033\'ean (v\'ed d\f2\lang1066\u7909?: s\u7889? con, s\u7889? s\u7843?n ph\u7849?m).\par
\f0\lang1033 +\f2\lang1066 Bi\u7871?n li\f0\lang1033\'ean t\f2\lang1066\u7909?c (Continuous variables): C\f0\lang1033\'e1c bi\f2\lang1066\u7871?n c\f0\lang1033\'f3 th\f2\lang1066\u7875? nh\u7853?n b\u7845?t k\u7923? gi\f0\lang1033\'e1 tr\f2\lang1066\u7883? n\f0\lang1033\'e0o trong m\f2\lang1066\u7897?t kho\u7843?ng (v\f0\lang1033\'ed d\f2\lang1066\u7909?: chi\u7873?u cao, c\f0\lang1033\'e2n n\f2\lang1066\u7863?ng).\par
\par
\cf1\b C\f0\lang1033\'e2u 2: \'dd ngh\f1\u297?a c\f2\lang1066\u7911?a ph\f0\lang1033\'e2n t\'edch ph\f1\u432?\u417?ng sai ANOVA v\f0\'e0 ki\f2\lang1066\u7875?m \f1\'f0\f2\u7883?nh khi b\f0\lang1033\'ecnh ph\f1\u432?\u417?ng trong nghi\f0\'ean c\f2\lang1066\u7913?u khoa h\u7885?c.\par
\cf0 Ph\f0\lang1033\'e2n t\'edch ph\f1\u432?\u417?ng sai ANOVA (Analysis of Variance):\b0\par
\f0 -\'dd ngh\f1\u297?a: ANOVA l\f0\'e0 m\f2\lang1066\u7897?t ph\f1\u432?\u417?ng ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p th\f2\lang1066\u7889?ng k\f0\lang1033\'ea d\'f9ng \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7875? so s\f0\lang1033\'e1nh trung b\'ecnh c\f2\lang1066\u7911?a hai hay nhi\u7873?u nh\f0\lang1033\'f3m. N\'f3 gi\'fap x\'e1c \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7883?nh xem c\f0\lang1033\'f3 s\f2\lang1066\u7921? kh\f0\lang1033\'e1c bi\f2\lang1066\u7879?t \f1\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e1ng k\f2\lang1066\u7875? v\u7873? m\u7863?t th\u7889?ng k\f0\lang1033\'ea gi\f2\lang1066\u7919?a c\f0\lang1033\'e1c nh\'f3m hay kh\'f4ng.\par
-\f2\lang1066\u7912?ng d\u7909?ng:\par
\f0\lang1033 +\f2\lang1066 So s\f0\lang1033\'e1nh hi\f2\lang1066\u7879?u qu\u7843? c\u7911?a c\f0\lang1033\'e1c ph\f1\u432?\u417?ng ph\f0\'e1p \f1\'f0i\f2\lang1066\u7873?u tr\u7883? kh\f0\lang1033\'e1c nhau.\par
+So s\'e1nh n\f1\'e3ng su\f2\lang1066\u7845?t c\u7911?a c\f0\lang1033\'e1c gi\f2\lang1066\u7889?ng c\f0\lang1033\'e2y tr\f2\lang1066\u7891?ng kh\f0\lang1033\'e1c nhau.\par
+So s\'e1nh m\f2\lang1066\u7913?c \f1\'f0\f2\u7897? h\f0\lang1033\'e0i l\'f2ng c\f2\lang1066\u7911?a kh\f0\lang1033\'e1ch h\'e0ng \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7889?i v\u7899?i c\f0\lang1033\'e1c s\f2\lang1066\u7843?n ph\u7849?m kh\f0\lang1033\'e1c nhau.\par
\b Ki\f2\lang1066\u7875?m \f1\'f0\f2\u7883?nh khi b\f0\lang1033\'ecnh ph\f1\u432?\u417?ng (Chi-square test):\par
\b0\f0 -\'dd ngh\f1\u297?a: Ki\f2\lang1066\u7875?m \f1\'f0\f2\u7883?nh khi b\f0\lang1033\'ecnh ph\f1\u432?\u417?ng l\f0\'e0 m\f2\lang1066\u7897?t ph\f1\u432?\u417?ng ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p th\f2\lang1066\u7889?ng k\f0\lang1033\'ea d\'f9ng \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7875? ki\u7875?m tra m\u7889?i quan h\u7879? gi\u7919?a hai bi\u7871?n \f1\'f0\f2\u7883?nh t\f0\lang1033\'ednh. N\'f3 gi\'fap x\'e1c \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7883?nh xem c\f0\lang1033\'f3 s\f2\lang1066\u7921? ph\u7909? thu\u7897?c gi\u7919?a hai bi\u7871?n hay kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng.\par
-\f2\lang1066\u7912?ng d\u7909?ng:\par
\f0\lang1033 +\f2\lang1066 Ki\u7875?m tra xem c\f0\lang1033\'f3 m\f2\lang1066\u7889?i li\f0\lang1033\'ean h\f2\lang1066\u7879? gi\u7919?a gi\u7899?i t\f0\lang1033\'ednh v\'e0 \'fd ki\f2\lang1066\u7871?n v\u7873? m\u7897?t v\u7845?n \f1\'f0\f2\u7873? n\f0\lang1033\'e0o \f1\'f0\f0\'f3.\par
+Ki\f2\lang1066\u7875?m tra xem c\f0\lang1033\'f3 m\f2\lang1066\u7889?i li\f0\lang1033\'ean h\f2\lang1066\u7879? gi\u7919?a tr\f0\lang1033\'ecnh \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7897? h\u7885?c v\u7845?n v\f0\lang1033\'e0 m\f2\lang1066\u7913?c thu nh\u7853?p.\par
\f0\lang1033 +\f2\lang1066 Ki\u7875?m tra xem c\f0\lang1033\'f3 m\f2\lang1066\u7889?i li\f0\lang1033\'ean h\f2\lang1066\u7879? gi\u7919?a lo\u7841?i thu\u7889?c v\f0\lang1033\'e0 hi\f2\lang1066\u7879?u qu\u7843? \f1\'f0i\f2\u7873?u tr\u7883?.\par
\par
\cf1\b C\f0\lang1033\'e2u 3: T\f2\lang1066\u7853?p h\u7907?p c\f0\lang1033\'e1c c\'e2u l\f2\lang1066\u7879?nh s\u7917? d\u7909?ng \f1\'f0\f2\u7875? ph\f0\lang1033\'e2n t\'edch ph\f1\u432?\u417?ng sai ANOVA v\f0\'e0 ki\f2\lang1066\u7875?m \f1\'f0\f2\u7883?nh khi b\f0\lang1033\'ecnh ph\f1\u432?\u417?ng trong SPSS.\par
\cf0 Ph\f0\'e2n t\'edch ph\f1\u432?\u417?ng sai ANOVA\b0 :\par
\i ONEWAY\i0 : Ph\f0\'e2n t\'edch ph\f1\u432?\u417?ng sai m\f2\lang1066\u7897?t y\u7871?u t\u7889?.\par
\i GLM\i0 : Ph\f0\lang1033\'e2n t\'edch ph\f1\u432?\u417?ng sai t\f2\lang1066\u7893?ng qu\f0\lang1033\'e1t (General Linear Model), c\'f3 th\f2\lang1066\u7875? s\u7917? d\u7909?ng cho nhi\u7873?u y\u7871?u t\u7889?.\par
\f0\lang1033 1.\f2\lang1066 V\f0\lang1033\'e0o menu: Analyze \f3\u8594?\f0  Compare Means \f3\u8594?\f0  One-Way ANOVA\par
2.Ch\f2\lang1066\u7885?n bi\u7871?n ph\u7909? thu\u7897?c (Dependent variable) v\f0\lang1033\'e0 bi\f2\lang1066\u7871?n nh\f0\lang1033\'f3m (Factor).\par
3.Ch\f2\lang1066\u7885?n Post Hoc (n\u7871?u c\u7847?n ki\u7875?m tra c\u7863?p \f1\'f0\f0\lang1033\'f4i).\par
4.K\f2\lang1066\u7871?t qu\u7843? hi\u7875?n th\u7883? b\u7843?ng ANOVA (F-test, Sig.).\par
\b Ki\u7875?m \f1\'f0\f2\u7883?nh khi b\f0\lang1033\'ecnh ph\f1\u432?\u417?ng:\par
\b0\i CROSSTABS\i0 : T\f2\lang1066\u7841?o b\u7843?ng t\u7847?n s\u7889? ch\f0\lang1033\'e9o gi\f2\lang1066\u7919?a hai bi\u7871?n \f1\'f0\f2\u7883?nh t\f0\lang1033\'ednh.\par
\i CHI-SQUARE\i0 : Th\f2\lang1066\u7921?c hi\u7879?n ki\u7875?m \f1\'f0\f2\u7883?nh khi b\f0\lang1033\'ecnh ph\f1\u432?\u417?ng.\par
\f0 1.\f1 V\f0\'e0o menu: Analyze \f3\u8594?\f0  Descriptive Statistics \f3\u8594?\f0  Crosstabs\par
2.Ch\f2\lang1066\u7885?n bi\u7871?n h\f0\lang1033\'e0ng v\'e0 bi\f2\lang1066\u7871?n c\u7897?t (c\u7843? hai l\f0\lang1033\'e0 \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7883?nh t\f0\lang1033\'ednh).\par
3.Ch\f2\lang1066\u7885?n Statistics \f3\u8594?\f0  Chi-square.\par
4.K\f2\lang1066\u7871?t qu\u7843? hi\u7875?n th\u7883? gi\f0\lang1033\'e1 tr\f2\lang1066\u7883? Chi-square, df, Sig.\par
\cf1\b C\f0\lang1033\'e2u 4: Chia tr\'ecnh \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7897? h\u7885?c v\u7845?n m\u7865? (tdhv) th\f0\lang1033\'e0nh 3 nh\'f3m: \par
Nh\'f3m 1 (T\f2\lang1066\u7915? ti\u7875?u h\u7885?c tr\u7903? xu\u7889?ng)\par
Nh\f0\lang1033\'f3m 2 (THCS)\par
Nh\'f3m 3 (THPT tr\f2\lang1066\u7903? l\f0\lang1033\'ean). \par
So s\'e1nh trung b\'ecnh \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7897? tu\u7893?i m\u7865? (tuoime) c\u7911?a 3 nh\f0\lang1033\'f3m n\'e0y v\f2\lang1066\u7899?i \f1\'f0\f2\u7897? tin c\u7853?y 95%.\cf0\f1\lang1033\par
\cf1\f0\par
\par
\par
C\'e2u 5: So s\'e1nh s\f2\lang1066\u7921?\f0\lang1033  kh\'e1c bi\f2\lang1066\u7879?\f0\lang1033 t gi\f2\lang1066\u7919?\f0\lang1033 a  trung b\'ecnh tu\f2\lang1066\u7893?\f0\lang1033 i thai theo tu\f2\lang1066\u7847?\f0\lang1033 n(tuoithai) theo ba nh\'f3m h\f2\lang1066\u7885?\f0\lang1033 c v\f2\lang1066\u7845?\f0\lang1033 n tr\'ean v\f2\lang1066\u7899?\f0\lang1033 i \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7897?\f0\lang1033  tin c\f2\lang1066\u7853?\f0\lang1033 y 95% \cf0\b0\f2\lang1066\par
\b\par
}
␀